# Rust build outputs — the image builds extensions from source in the
# rust-builder stage. Shipping host artifacts into the context is slow and
# risks the stale-binary problem this build was changed to avoid.
# Note: patterns need **/ to match below the context root.
p2/s3/*/target/
p2/s3/*/dist/
wheels/
**/*.so
**/*.bak
.stale-backup/
